---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: report
---
$ nabu new Bad_Name
exit 1
error: invalid tablet name "Bad_Name": use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens, and start with a letter or digit
fix: use a name like "bad-name"

$ nabu new a_b
exit 1
error: invalid tablet name "a_b": use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens, and start with a letter or digit
fix: use a name like "a-b"

$ nabu new demo/1st
exit 1
error: invalid slice name "1st": use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens, and start with a letter
fix: use a name like "my-name"

$ nabu new demo/Up
exit 1
error: invalid slice name "Up": use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens, and start with a letter
fix: use a name like "up"

$ nabu new a/b/c
exit 1
error: invalid target "a/b/c": expected <tablet> or <tablet>/<slice>
fix: nabu new <tablet>/<slice>

$ nabu new demo/
exit 1
error: invalid slice name "": use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens, and start with a letter
fix: use a name like "my-name"
